    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll step into the shoes of a high school freshman and meet three unique girls\u2014each with a completely different perspective on the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you get to know them, you\u2019ll listen to their stories and search for answers to life\u2019s big questions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey will lead you to decide what kind of path you truly want to follow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you\u2019ll uncover the world\u2019s nonlinear structure and the mysteries hidden beneath the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654640/extras/9df509d453f160816d62e4c02a771602.avif?t=1754643783\" width=600 height=216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique and <i>teasing </i>characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surprise scenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep lore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bit of 90s nostalgia</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features controls that go beyond a typical visual novel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Existential crisis</p></li></ul>",
